{
 "duration": 28.423,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every year Tom buys his sister hiking gear, and every year she already owns it.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.956
  },
  {
   "text": "This year he gives her goals instead.",
   "start": 5.206,
   "end": 7.155
  },
  {
   "text": "A 2027 year planner with a hike-a-week challenge,",
   "start": 7.405,
   "end": 11.095
  },
  {
   "text": "a logbook for Colorado 14ers, New Hampshire 4,000-footers and the Adirondack High Peaks,",
   "start": 11.295,
   "end": 17.708
  },
  {
   "text": "and a tracker for every national park.",
   "start": 17.908,
   "end": 19.835
  },
  {
   "text": "She prints them that night and circles her first peak.",
   "start": 20.085,
   "end": 22.809
  },
  {
   "text": "By January she has a plan for the whole year.",
   "start": 23.059,
   "end": 25.628
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for the hiker who has everything.",
   "start": 25.928,
   "end": 28.223
  }
 ],
